This repository builds, and its published images contain and redistribute, Ghidra:

    Ghidra: https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra
    Copyright National Security Agency and contributors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Ghidra is not modified. Its LICENSE and licenses/ directory are carried unmodified inside
every published image at /opt/ghidra/; the only file added is a decompiler binary built from
the source tag matching the release, at
Ghidra/Features/Decompiler/os/linux_arm_64/decompile, a path the release zip leaves empty.

The published image is built on eclipse-temurin (GPLv2 with the Classpath Exception), which
carries its own licence text inside the image. The Debian container used to compile the
decompiler is a build-time dependency only and is not part of any published image.
